## Precompressed copies, conditional requests, byte ranges, HEAD

$ curl -H Accept-Encoding: gzip https://bareproxy.com:8443/platform/
HTTP/2 200 
  bareproxy-id: c3164da50cfebe1b
  content-encoding: gzip
  content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
  etag: "18da92c22d0d2aac-c4d-gz"
  vary: Accept-Encoding

$ curl -H If-None-Match: "18da92c22d0d2aac-48bc" https://bareproxy.com:8443/platform/
HTTP/2 304 
  bareproxy-id: fb8d8f1c035e1072
  etag: "18da92c22d0d2aac-48bc"
  vary: Accept-Encoding

$ curl -r 0-99 https://bareproxy.com:8443/images/plan-demo.png
HTTP/2 206 
  bareproxy-id: cedf51d7bbcfb2d0
  content-range: bytes 0-99/72732
  content-type: image/png
  etag: "18da912ee0eda4dd-11c1c"

$ curl -I https://bareproxy.com:8443/about/
HTTP/2 200 
  bareproxy-id: 02785a6607077fef
  content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
  etag: "18da92c22ce2a233-26a3"
