## The API behind /api/: prefix stripped, forwarded headers, request ID passed on

$ curl https://bareproxy.com:8443/api/orders?x=1
HTTP/2 200 
  bareproxy-id: 98c87d7fce44fb8a
  content-type: application/json
  body: {"backend":"api-1","path":"/orders?x=1","host":"bareproxy.com:8443","x_forwarded_for":"127.0.0.1","x_forwarded_proto":"https","bareproxy_id":"98c87d7fce44fb8a"} 

$ curl https://bareproxy.com:8443/api/orders?x=2
HTTP/2 200 
  bareproxy-id: c500177b803c3d3b
  content-type: application/json
  body: {"backend":"api-2","path":"/orders?x=2","host":"bareproxy.com:8443","x_forwarded_for":"127.0.0.1","x_forwarded_proto":"https","bareproxy_id":"c500177b803c3d3b"} 

